# What the Vercel Function does not need at runtime.
#
# The CLI uploads the directory as it stands and does not read .gitignore, so anything a local run
# leaves behind is shipped unless it is named here. Agent worktrees under .claude/ each hold a full
# copy of the repository and a junction to node_modules; build artefacts and test output are never
# read by agent/service.mjs.
.claude/
.impeccable/
.playwright-mcp/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
out/
out-halmos/
cache/
broadcast/
verification/
